        <mxCell id="s_spoof" value="S • SPOOFING&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stolen login or password reset abuse&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Could take over a customer account." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F1FB;strokeColor=#4F81BD;fontColor=#202124;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
